 "spent_usd_total": 0.92333,
 "findings": [
  "With the computed facts in the payload, the auditor stopped all 19 wrong payments the weakened rules let through (12 above the approval limit, 7 already paid, 2 with a required document missing; one claim raised two) and 1 of 46 right ones.",
  "Without the facts (first check) it stopped the one wrong payment and all four right ones: the model's own date arithmetic and its reading of the receipt were wrong, not its reading of the terms.",
  "The facts section names a missing document, an earlier payment and a total above the limit outright, so most catches are the model reading a fact and quoting the term; the one catch the facts did not spell out was the surgery without a diagnosis certificate (surgery_diagnosis_mismatch).",
  "The one false flag judged an in-situ carcinoma code (D05.1) against the C-prefix exclusion and the admission ward against the diagnosis: a person's look, not money.",
  "On the sound run it agreed with every correct payment: 0 of 46.",
  "About 0.003 USD and 0.8 s per decision at Haiku 4.5 prices.",
  "Repeated twice more, the degraded run caught 19 of 19 wrong payments each time; the one false flag of the first run did not recur (1, 0, 0), and 64 of 65 decisions were judged the same in all three runs.",
  "On a control whose breakages the facts section does not name (a grade and a date off by one, no deductible), the auditor stopped 48 of 49 wrong payments by reading the documents' rows and the terms against the decision; so 'it only reads the facts' is half true: when the facts are silent it reads the documents, at 2.4 s instead of 0.8 s."
 ],
 "limitations": [
  "Synthetic claims and a synthetic policy table; the weakened mode is the three breakages the gate's control uses, not a catalogue of real failures.",
  "The facts are computed by the same code base as the rules; they are independent of the decision (documents, terms, ledger) but a bug shared by both would be invisible to the auditor.",
  "The auditor can only add a review reason; whether a person agrees with it was not measured.",
  "The subtle control has no correct payment, so its false-flag rate is unmeasured; its three breakages are the author's, not a catalogue.",
  "Seven batches cost 0.92333 USD, kept apart from the cumulative API cost in EVIDENCE.md."
 ],
